Eze 14:1 , God answers idolaters according to their own heart;
Eze 14:6 , They are exhorted to repent, for fear of judgments, by means of seduced prophets;
Eze 14:12 , God's irrevocable sentence of famine;
Eze 14:15 , of noisome beasts;
Eze 14:17 , of the sword;
Eze 14:19 , and of pestilence;
Eze 14:22 , A remnant shall be reserved for example of others.
